 are still live, but they won't be for long.</p><div class="col-body"><section class="mb-5 2xl:hidden px-0" id="article-toc-49c602cd-c78b-4ee9-b39d-a432d255789c"><details class="rounded-lg border border-dirty-seagull bg-white"><!-- -2 children --></details></section></div><h3 class="heading-mb col-body text-[1.125rem]/[1.375rem] font-bold charcoal-color" data-jump-link-target="" id="popular-memorial-day-tech-deals-still-live">Popular Memorial Day tech deals still live</h3><p class="mb-4 min-w-0 leading-7 break-words md:leading-8 col-body text-[18px] charcoal-color"><a data-ylk="elm:affiliate_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;sellerN:Amazon;cpos:1;pos:1;pkgt:horizontal-editorial;subsec:commlist;uuid:rYZJ4QUgC4fx8H8X0282" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Apple AirPods Pro 3 for $229 (was $249):&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;affiliate_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;ySellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yPackageType&quot;:&quot;horizontal-editorial&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;commlist&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:true}" href="https://shopping.yahoo.com/rdlw?merchantId=66ea567a-c987-4c2e-a2ff-02904efde6ea&itemId=amazon_B0FQFB8FMG&siteId=us-tech&pageId=1p-autolink&contentUuid=49c602cd-c78b-4ee9-b39d-a432d255789c&featureId=text-link&merchantName=Amazon&linkText=Apple+AirPods+Pro+3+for+%24229+%28was+%24249%29%3A&&signature=AQAAAcJXfwb-H6StdwEUAFyvvsjssZdFHhZwrJvY9HRhXrve&gcReferrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FApple-Cancellation-Translation-Headphones-High-Fidelity%2Fdp%2FB0FQFB8FMG&spaceId=1197810144&uuid=rYZJ4QUgC4fx8H8X0282" class="link rapid-with-clickid" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" target="_blank" data-aps-asc-tag="tech-p-v-apo-20" data-aps-asin="B0FQFB8FMG" data-rapid_p="112" data-aps-status="read"><strong>Apple AirPods Pro 3 for $229 (was $249):</strong></a><strong> Lowest price since launch</strong><br><a data-ylk="slk